    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "asha",
        "speaker": "Asha",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 75,
        "text": "Did you visit the two apartments in the Riverside neighborhood, Omar?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6417713ad270cf2085d521cf1303556e055fc295d0fa501f49c4bf77e843530e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 82,
        "sourceEnd": 178,
        "text": "Yes. The Pine Street apartment has a monthly rent of 650 pounds. The Cedar Street one costs 690.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "65a25ff1e8ca3b47d0ec910b043fe7eba9100df73a0fe7b2e6872253acaec215",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "asha",
        "speaker": "Asha",
        "sourceStart": 185,
        "sourceEnd": 212,
        "text": "Which one is more spacious?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8da529348bb87564d80addad6fd3386b0683ef173efcf6e71aa97f2b17b61317",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 219,
        "sourceEnd": 328,
        "text": "Pine has the bigger bedroom, but the kitchen is smaller than Cedar's. The bathroom is private in both places.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "29e0baae5aab25e4ad13c119727b2d896dbaabadd8f7f5b8ce6d5f140eec0b82",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "asha",
        "speaker": "Asha",
        "sourceStart": 335,
        "sourceEnd": 364,
        "text": "Does Pine have any furniture?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "204712274499aee304d23c492fe4a96ab7c75d13f6fa11ae91763e11bf64d519",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 371,
        "sourceEnd": 543,
        "text": "Yes, a sofa and a small table. I checked the floor and took a picture of a stain on the ceiling. The wall is a pale color. There was no leak near the window when I visited.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9d2a4a82e34b1e790e0a2d3484cef0c137b80de9ede60b64def7bc599fad91ef",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "asha",
        "speaker": "Asha",
        "sourceStart": 550,
        "sourceEnd": 590,
        "text": "What did the landlord say about heating?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8bdbb2533e94018e67476c4b2bb729a97ce16e8474c3b57d54cf45983ca88bff",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 597,
        "sourceEnd": 716,
        "text": "Heating uses electricity. The electricity charge is included in the rent, and there is no gas supply in that apartment.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "30488b1eff3c5bd6ed84fa03c8ba254b1548cb5bf1da259e867b4c69ec56eac3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "asha",
        "speaker": "Asha",
        "sourceStart": 723,
        "sourceEnd": 767,
        "text": "Did you ask about the deposit and the lease?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "04453abf3d49f2d4712231077c1b138135cae21e8a6a3121711dc0f4bdddc8ee",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 774,
        "sourceEnd": 933,
        "text": "The draft contract lists a deposit of 300 pounds and a six-month lease. I want to read the agreement carefully and ask about any existing damage before I sign.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "59e599451469d00ba56567c4677ce5ab5c84d2639d89f703fe9771974fe49ddf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "asha",
        "speaker": "Asha",
        "sourceStart": 940,
        "sourceEnd": 967,
        "text": "What about the Cedar place?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ace17899c0935adb53531c03b9493a081398c69d7e6b8d7b38ca2c503723d5cc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 974,
        "sourceEnd": 1140,
        "text": "The ceiling is lower, but the window in the living room is larger. It is as quiet as Pine in the afternoon. The front door looks secure, though I will check it again.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "01b6cdb4b008aea120d3449e3bd60b7ab682295158b8d7f0f0aaee317ffbe970",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "asha",
        "speaker": "Asha",
        "sourceStart": 1147,
        "sourceEnd": 1175,
        "text": "When would you need to move?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "df545f451a34715273ea1246b5b89e452febd24cbdac5bb96298ca9f8bd7c887",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 1182,
        "sourceEnd": 1319,
        "text": "The suggested date is Saturday. I have the address written here. First, I will ask whether the landlord can repair a loose cupboard door.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "08f6f4de80cb33994ef5d5ab2017f561a58cc11b0f95c35876e3e7ae97deab94",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "asha",
        "speaker": "Asha",
        "sourceStart": 1326,
        "sourceEnd": 1354,
        "text": "Do you have to decide today?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8ac7586ea0c466b0925f17fc1fcab217eba7b63ae74260d109ab2ada086f1303",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 1361,
        "sourceEnd": 1471,
        "text": "No. I can take the information home and compare the rooms, any other bill and the travel time before replying.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e00677a95548640692817068a934151ebd2c99fa39b90e423294cd460d629536",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
